# Build outputs (cmake / intermediate)
build/
out/
dist/
bin/
obj/
target/
artifacts/
node_modules/
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
cmake-build-*/

# Local config / logs
config.json
*.log

# Compiled binaries in tree (CI produces under dist/ ; packaging/tools/)
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
!third_party/**


# OS / editor
.arena/
.cache/
.local/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~

# Extra docs (do not track) — 仓库内维护的说明文档例外
docs/
*.md
!README.md
!packaging/README.md
!tools/devcheck/README.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 安装包打包（packaging/）
#   打包脚本与配置需要进版本库（pack.ps1 / packaging.config.json / README.md）；
#   安装器工具链（源码快照 → kirara-builder.exe）在独立项目 Kirara
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
packaging/tools/

# Web UI
src/Ui/node_modules/
src/Ui/dist/
src/Ui/*.tsbuildinfo

assets-gen/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# devcheck（tools/devcheck/）—— 本地快速体检，见 tools/devcheck/README.md
#   检查用的源码是生成物，不入库；说明文档要入库（上面 *.md 被忽略）
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
tools/devcheck/rust/*/src/gen/
tools/devcheck/front/gen/
tools/devcheck/front/.prettierrc
tools/devcheck/_selftest/
tools/devcheck/front/_selftest/
# -SelfTest 的仓库内改动锁与备份（进程被杀后靠它们恢复并清场）
tools/devcheck/.repo-lock
tools/devcheck/.selftest-backup/
!tools/devcheck/README.md
